{"id":"c34","stage":5,"title":"承认反对意见","scene":"构建有让步和回应的论证。","roles":["研究伙伴","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c34-1","ko":"반대 의견을 글에 넣으면 주장이 약해지지 않을까요?","zh":"把反对意见写进文章，会不会削弱自己的主张？","note":"提出对写作方法的疑问。","words":[{"term":"반대","zh":"反对","id":"8b41caa49fef042d","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3"},{"term":"글","zh":"文章","id":"f77a9ef73a929938","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"},{"term":"약해지다","zh":"变弱","id":"5a73fd2e4d09e084","audio":"/audio/5a73fd2e4d09e084fb48.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b515f87452d21daf9b34.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"반대","meaning":"反对","explanation":"반대修饰의견。","readings":[{"term":"반대","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3"}]},{"text":"의견을","meaning":"意见","explanation":"의견（意见）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"의견을","audio":"/audio/694a8810e6e05426defc.mp3"}]},{"text":"글에","meaning":"在文章里","explanation":"글（文章）+ 에（放入的位置）。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}]},{"text":"넣으면","meaning":"如果放入","explanation":"넣다（放入）+ -으면（条件）。","readings":[{"term":"넣으면","audio":"/audio/d6a16231b39a82c5483a.mp3"}]},{"text":"주장이","meaning":"主张","explanation":"주장（主张）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"주장이","audio":"/audio/f1af4dd6f8009674b77a.mp3"}]},{"text":"약해지지","meaning":"变弱","explanation":"약해지다（变弱）+ -지，连接않다。","readings":[{"term":"약해지다","audio":"/audio/5a73fd2e4d09e084fb48.mp3"}]},{"text":"않을까요?","meaning":"会不会？","explanation":"않다 + -을까요；否定疑问在此表达担忧。","readings":[{"term":"않을까요","audio":"/audio/ef645ed401b3e6751b53.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c34-2","ko":"오히려 한계를 인정하고 대응하면 설득력이 높아질 수 있어요.","zh":"相反，承认局限并作出回应，反而可能增强说服力。","note":"오히려 引出与预想相反的判断。","words":[{"term":"오히려","zh":"反而","id":"b499084b40ea381f","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3"},{"term":"인정하다","zh":"承认","id":"3226597a4296c34d","audio":"/audio/3226597a4296c34d3b63.mp3"},{"term":"설득력","zh":"说服力","id":"428d6766f60154c0","audio":"/audio/428d6766f60154c0fc32.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/e9e4e791c80927e721b3.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"오히려","meaning":"反而","explanation":"오히려引出与预期相反的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오히려","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3"}]},{"text":"한계를","meaning":"局限","explanation":"한계（局限）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"한계를","audio":"/audio/df9eddf895fa898a8695.mp3"}]},{"text":"인정하고","meaning":"承认并","explanation":"인정하다（承认）+ -고（连接）。","readings":[{"term":"인정하다","audio":"/audio/3226597a4296c34d3b63.mp3"}]},{"text":"대응하면","meaning":"回应的话","explanation":"대응하다（应对、回应）+ -면（条件）。","readings":[{"term":"대응하면","audio":"/audio/3e7039e678a0e564f917.mp3"}]},{"text":"설득력이","meaning":"说服力","explanation":"설득력（说服力）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"설득력","audio":"/audio/428d6766f60154c0fc32.mp3"}]},{"text":"높아질","meaning":"增强","explanation":"높아지다（提高）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"높아질","audio":"/audio/d414a5fe48c4ef32448a.mp3"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다表示可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다的礼貌形式，与前文组成“可能增强”。","readings":[{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c34-3","ko":"그럼 상대의 주장을 공정하게 정리하는 게 먼저겠네요.","zh":"那首先应公正地梳理对方的主张。","note":"先准确理解，再回应。","words":[{"term":"상대","zh":"对方","id":"6a3b6fa71b551942","audio":"/audio/6a3b6fa71b551942a1be.mp3"},{"term":"공정하다","zh":"公正","id":"a2293b5ce97ee0ff","audio":"/audio/a2293b5ce97ee0fff6ce.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a34d09c81d33f283d17a.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那","explanation":"그러면的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}]},{"text":"상대의","meaning":"对方的","explanation":"상대（对方）+ 의（所属关系）；此处不是“相对”。","readings":[{"term":"상대","audio":"/audio/6a3b6fa71b551942a1be.mp3"}]},{"text":"주장을","meaning":"主张","explanation":"주장（主张）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"주장을","audio":"/audio/891959fcf7b098f7ecdb.mp3"}]},{"text":"공정하게","meaning":"公正地","explanation":"공정하다（公正）+ -게（修饰动作）。","readings":[{"term":"공정하다","audio":"/audio/a2293b5ce97ee0fff6ce.mp3"}]},{"text":"정리하는","meaning":"梳理的","explanation":"정리하다（整理）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"정리하는","audio":"/audio/81a168cc1e3be5558d25.mp3"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事","explanation":"것이的缩略，整个梳理行为作主语。","readings":[{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}]},{"text":"먼저겠네요.","meaning":"应该优先呢","explanation":"먼저（先、第一位）+ -겠네요（判断与新认识）；这里表示优先顺序。","readings":[{"term":"먼저겠네요","audio":"/audio/6702df367f949033908f.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c34-4","ko":"맞아요. 일부만 떼어 내서 비판하면 논의가 왜곡돼요.","zh":"是的，只抽取一部分来批判，会歪曲讨论。","note":"-아/어 내다 在这里强调取出。","words":[{"term":"비판하다","zh":"批判","id":"d86bad9e81619459","audio":"/audio/d86bad9e81619459e870.mp3"},{"term":"논의","zh":"讨论","id":"bd99218b7737dbf8","audio":"/audio/bd99218b7737dbf86b48.mp3"},{"term":"왜곡되다","zh":"被歪曲","id":"d89b7eacf48be454","audio":"/audio/d89b7eacf48be4544a23.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/670967dcfb9ad745be43.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"是的","explanation":"맞다（正确）的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}]},{"text":"일부만","meaning":"只取部分","explanation":"일부（部分）+ 만（只）。","readings":[{"term":"일부만","audio":"/audio/02c0a514b5438b660b1c.mp3"}]},{"text":"떼어","meaning":"拆出","explanation":"떼다（分离、摘出）+ -어，连接내다。","readings":[{"term":"떼어","audio":"/audio/2963a84a7ce6d53d66b7.mp3"}]},{"text":"내서","meaning":"取出后","explanation":"내다（取出）+ -어서（连接）；떼어 내다为“摘取出来”。","readings":[{"term":"내서","audio":"/audio/0d5aa8a8c5784d219e6d.mp3"}]},{"text":"비판하면","meaning":"如果批判","explanation":"비판하다（批判）+ -면（条件）。","readings":[{"term":"비판하다","audio":"/audio/d86bad9e81619459e870.mp3"}]},{"text":"논의가","meaning":"讨论","explanation":"논의（讨论）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"논의","audio":"/audio/bd99218b7737dbf86b48.mp3"}]},{"text":"왜곡돼요.","meaning":"会被歪曲","explanation":"왜곡되다（被歪曲）→ 왜곡돼요。","readings":[{"term":"왜곡되다","audio":"/audio/d89b7eacf48be4544a23.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c34-5","ko":"타당한 부분은 수용하되 핵심 쟁점에는 근거로 답해야겠어요.","zh":"应接受合理部分，同时就核心争议提供依据来回应。","note":"-되 表示承认前项，同时补充限制。","words":[{"term":"타당하다","zh":"合理","id":"e830ef5f5e1b9282","audio":"/audio/e830ef5f5e1b92822bc7.mp3"},{"term":"수용하다","zh":"接受","id":"01c1d71f61779131","audio":"/audio/01c1d71f61779131c6d5.mp3"},{"term":"쟁점","zh":"争议焦点","id":"d160902bdf2c3007","audio":"/audio/d160902bdf2c3007070a.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/f106ab52a917aa38e696.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"타당한","meaning":"合理的","explanation":"타당하다（合理）+ -ㄴ（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"타당하다","audio":"/audio/e830ef5f5e1b92822bc7.mp3"}]},{"text":"부분은","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분（部分）+ 은（对比话题）。","readings":[{"term":"부분은","audio":"/audio/02b817b32edb3b13b7e6.mp3"}]},{"text":"수용하되","meaning":"接受，同时","explanation":"수용하다（接受）+ -되（承认前项，同时补充条件或限制）。","readings":[{"term":"수용하다","audio":"/audio/01c1d71f61779131c6d5.mp3"}]},{"text":"핵심","meaning":"核心","explanation":"핵심修饰쟁점。","readings":[{"term":"쟁점","audio":"/audio/d160902bdf2c3007070a.mp3"}]},{"text":"쟁점에는","meaning":"就争议焦点","explanation":"쟁점（争议焦点）+ 에（回应对象）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"쟁점","audio":"/audio/d160902bdf2c3007070a.mp3"}]},{"text":"근거로","meaning":"用依据","explanation":"근거（依据）+ 로（手段）。","readings":[{"term":"근거로","audio":"/audio/ffa827ffc10f7af58bdd.mp3"}]},{"text":"답해야겠어요.","meaning":"应作出回应","explanation":"답하다（回答）+ -아/어야（必须）+ -겠-（判断）+ -어요。","readings":[{"term":"답해야겠어요","audio":"/audio/e42ea1ef75b457b18497.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c34-6","ko":"그런 방식이 단순한 주장 반복보다 효과적이에요.","zh":"这种方式比单纯重复主张更有效。","note":"用比较句给出评价。","words":[{"term":"단순하다","zh":"单纯","id":"c726c85752cf20a0","audio":"/audio/c726c85752cf20a04d17.mp3"},{"term":"반복","zh":"重复","id":"58902391b9377fdd","audio":"/audio/58902391b9377fdd405f.mp3"},{"term":"효과적","zh":"有效的","id":"47f7fe7544643353","audio":"/audio/47f7fe75446433539c1b.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/04e5077a28d7ad91293e.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那样的","explanation":"그런指前文承认合理部分再回应的方法。","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}]},{"text":"방식이","meaning":"方式","explanation":"방식（方式）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"방식이","audio":"/audio/71b57b0bc1bf7758cc5b.mp3"}]},{"text":"단순한","meaning":"单纯的","explanation":"단순하다（单纯）+ -ㄴ（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"단순하다","audio":"/audio/c726c85752cf20a04d17.mp3"}]},{"text":"주장","meaning":"主张","explanation":"주장修饰반복。","readings":[{"term":"반복","audio":"/audio/58902391b9377fdd405f.mp3"}]},{"text":"반복보다","meaning":"比重复","explanation":"반복（重复）+ 보다（比较基准）。","readings":[{"term":"반복","audio":"/audio/58902391b9377fdd405f.mp3"}]},{"text":"효과적이에요.","meaning":"更有效","explanation":"효과적（有效的）+ 이에요（是，礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"효과적","audio":"/audio/47f7fe75446433539c1b.mp3"}]}]}],"day":166,"sequenceScore":2.6267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["那首先应忽略对方的主张。","那首先应公正地梳理对方的主张。","那首先应重复自己的主张。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["应拒绝对方所有合理部分，只重复自己的结论。","应接受对方所有主张，不再讨论核心争议。","应接受合理部分，同时就核心争议提供依据来回应。"],"answer":2}]}
